   136	> smooth projective curves, so `\bar D~_l` is rational by Lüroth; `g = 0`.
   137	>
   138	> (ii) *One place at infinity.* `D~_l` is affine (finite over the affine `D_l`),
   139	> so `S := \bar D~_l \ D~_l ≠ ∅`. `h_l(A^1) ⊆ D~_l`, so
   140	> `h̄_l^{-1}(S) ⊆ {∞}`. `h̄_l` is surjective, so every point of `S` has nonempty
   141	> preimage inside the one-point set `{∞}`: `#S = 1`.
   142	>
   143	> So `D~_l ≅ P^1 \ {1 point} ≅ A^1`. ∎
