   538	has `r ∈ {j-1, j}` and cyclic torsion, forcing `u <= 1`, `v <= 1`; and
   539	`chi(Delta) = 1 - r + u(1/p - 1) + v(1/q - 1) = M(1/p + 1/q - 1)`.
