   550	Guardrail audit. `{T=0}`, `Phi`, the target place `q_infty`, and the generic
   551	ramified factor of `theta:(1.7)` were kept distinct and none was used. No pole
   552	identity, no valuation floor, and no partition row was invoked; `Theta_h` does
   553	not appear. `Aff_2` was declared as a group action on the *target*, with its
   554	effect on `kappa` (multiplication by the determinant) stated, not assumed away.
   555	The `[A^5]E`-vs-(N0) collapse and the two generator-bracket evaluations are
