+## 0. Integrity, scope, and verdict
+
+Before reading the mathematics, `shasum -a 256` on the five frozen copies in
+`/private/var/folders/80/jm5p82hn56g0crpvv9xjzrc00000gn/T/jc2-lane.XicF3D/inputs`
